# api http test requests for VSCode rest client

### get cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/41

### post new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozOCwibmFtZSI6IlVsbGEgUyIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoidWxsYXMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InVsbGFzQG1ldHJvcG9saWEuZmkiLCJyb2xlIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3NjU0OTM4NjgsImV4cCI6MTc2NTU4MDI2OH0.cNHplEX-rBdb0B2dR-UWNR1vhUDg-cYy65Dw_DhVKeQ

{
  "cat_name": "New Cat",
  "weight": 5,
  "owner": 38,
  "filename": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat",
